    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Milton Maltz built Malrite Communications Group from Cleveland radio roots into a major broadcasting company with radio, television, and cable holdings. His life and work connected entrepreneurship, media, Jewish community leadership, and philanthropy, including sustained support for cultural institutions, Holocaust education, public broadcasting, and civic life in Northeast Ohio."
    ]
